+Subject: [PATCH] Lock default homepage to AO3 and force DoH endpoint on Android
+
+This patch injects default preferences and a startup switch to force the
+homepage to https://ao3.org and to use the specified DoH endpoint. It is
+implemented for the Android build by adding a small Java helper that sets
+secure prefs on first run and by adding a command-line flag injection for
+the network process.
